			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1321723">
									

<p>I think the high amount of mental manipulation floating around might kind of cause the society to stagnate. If the ideal is someone who follows the great philosophers and thinks the current state of society is just perfect, and there exists the technology to make people think this way, that'll kind of prevent it from ever changing.</p>
<p>I'm envisioning a society that has basically and deliberately trimmed out all the non-stereotyped bits of its culture. It's as though 1950s America was able to make everyone think that the lifestyle of white, middle-class, suburbia with two and a half kids and a dog was the perfect ideal.</p>

